  "notes": "Cause code is TBD/provisional per FORM-366 fields, despite a detailed apparent-cause narrative identifying a single point vulnerability in the common filter circuit; category left as 'provisional' per rule 4. No previous similar events reported. EN 55028 captured as ens_number. Auxiliary Feedwater Pump (non-safety, distinct from EFW) mentioned only as means of securing EFW automatic standby -- not modeled as a separate System node since it's not clearly identified with an EIIS code and plays only a minor operational role; treated as part of narrative context rather than a distinct node to avoid overmodeling."
